(MASTER FREELANCE CONSULTING AND SERVICES AGREEMENT) ' 
(This Agreement is dated as of October 6, 2026, between Client Corp and Consultant.) ' 
() ' 
(SECTION 1. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY OWNERSHIP ASSIGNMENT) ' 
(Consultant hereby irrevocably assigns, transfers, and conveys to Client all right, title,) ' 
