() ' 
(SECTION 2. EXCLUSIVITY AND EXCLUSIVE SERVICES) ' 
(During the term of this Agreement, Consultant agrees to render consulting services exclusively) ' 
(to Client and covenants not to perform software development or AI services for any competitor.) ' 
() ' 
(SECTION 3. CAP ON LIABILITY) ' 
(To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the total aggregate liability of either party) ' 
(arising out of or relating to this Agreement shall be strictly capped and limited to the total fees) ' 
(actually paid by Client to Consultant during the twelve \(12\) months preceding the claim.) ' 
() ' 
(SECTION 4. LIQUIDATED DAMAGES) ' 
(In the event Consultant fails to meet project deliverables by the agreed deadline or breaches) ' 
(project milestones, Consultant shall pay Client liquidated damages of five thousand dollars) ' 
(\(,000\) per day of delay as a reasonable pre-estimate of damages and not as a penalty.) ' 
() ' 
(SECTION 5. CHANGE OF CONTROL) ' 
(In the event of a Change of Control of Consultant or acquisition by a third party of more than) ' 
(fifty percent \(50%\) of voting equity, Client shall have the unilateral right to terminate immediately.) ' 
